    "title": "What channel is Iowa State vs Tennessee State on today? Time, TV for March Madness game",
    "text": "Updated March 20, 2026, 1:30 p.m. CTIowa State men's basketball will play Tennessee State in the first round of the 2026 NCAA Tournament.The No. 2-seed Cyclones (27-7) have been among the nation's best teams all season and will be looking to make a deeper run than their current core has in recent seasons. The No. 15-seed Tigers (23-9) won the Ohio Valley Conference tournament and come into March Madness riding a six game win streak.Check below for when and where to watch Iowa State's first-round matchup in the NCAA Tournament: Watch Iowa State basketball vs Tennessee State NCAA Tournament game on FUBO (free trial)What channel is Iowa State vs Tennessee State on today in March Madness?TV channel: CBSStream: NCAA March Madness Live app | FUBO (free trial)Iowa State will tip off vs. Tennessee State on CBS. Streaming options include the NCAA March Madness Live app and FUBO, which offers a free trial. Announcers for the game are Spero Dedes and Jim Spanarkel.Iowa State vs Tennessee State start time in NCAA bracketDate: Friday, March 20Time: Originally scheduled for 1:50 p.m. CT (Kentucky vs. Santa Clara went into overtime, so the Iowa State game will be pushed back to approximately 2:05 p.m. CT)Location: Enterprise Center in St. Louis, MissouriIowa State and Tennessee State will play at approximately 2:05 p.m. CT at Enterprise Center in St. Louis, Missouri.Iowa State vs Tennessee State odds in March MadnessOdds courtesy of BetMGM as of Thursday evening.Spread: Iowa State -24.5Over/under: 148.5Moneyline: Iowa State -10000, Tennessee State +2000Iowa State basketball schedule 2025-26Below are the past five games of Iowa State's 2025-26 basketball season. For the full schedule, click here.March 2: Iowa State at Arizona, L 57-73March 7: Iowa State vs Arizona State, W 86-65March 11: Iowa State vs Arizona State, W 91-42March 12: Iowa State vs Texas Tech, W 75-53March 13: Iowa State vs Arizona, L 80-82Tennessee State basketball schedule 2025-26Below are the past fiv